"description": "Fulton Financial Corp. is a financial holding company, which through its subsidiaries, engages in the provision of consumer and commercial banking products and services. The firm offers checking account and savings deposit products, certificates of deposit and individual retirement accounts. It also provides investment management, trust, brokerage, insurance and investment advisory services to consumer and commercial banking customers in the market areas serviced by the subsidiary banks. The company was founded on February 8, 1982 and is headquartered in Lancaster, PA.",
